line 16 extra: by-design spec §1.2 arrays are homogeneous, so an array literal's elements must share one type
line 16 type: by-design spec §1.2 arrays are homogeneous, so an array literal's elements must share one type
line 5 type: by-design spec §1.3 keeps an array never filled as `never[]`; tsc reports its unobserved declaration as `any[]`. SUB-2101 supports evolving reads after writes, but this case has no writes to infer from.
